//
// File: zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_2d_state.zia
// Purpose: Persistent fields and deterministic initialization for the 2D scene editor controller.
// Key invariants:
//   - InitializeState assigns every field before any focused layer is pumped.
// Ownership/Lifetime:
//   - The final SceneEditor2D facade owns inherited state and retained handles.
// Links: zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_2d.zia, zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_2d_contract_05.zia
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

